    skos:scopeNote "Source reverse-item numbering is preserved in the contextual key and requires clarification before implementing a scoring algorithm; this concept does not establish a depression diagnosis. Source evidence: resultsSection.outcomeMeasuresModule.outcomeMeasures[0]. Taxonomy identity does not imply supported statistical interpretation." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> ;
