    skos:scopeNote "Class size is a class-level count. Use pupil-teacher-ratio indicators for pupils per teacher across an institution or education level; the two can differ because teachers may teach multiple classes or provide subgroup and one-to-one instruction." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> ;
