    skos:inScheme indicator: ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cortisol level" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Concentration is a physiological biomarker, not a direct mental-health outcome, subjective stress score, or diagnosis. Preserve specimen, assay, timing and exposure-window context; hair and fluid concentrations are not interchangeable. Higher or lower values alone do not establish benefit, harm, a cause of stress, or an intervention effect." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> ;
