    skos:prefLabel "Outness Inventory 11-item mean score with zero coding" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Zero denotes not applicable or absence of the relationship. Preserve that coding and do not silently treat zero as concealed identity or equate to versions excluding not-applicable responses. Source evidence: resultsSection.outcomeMeasuresModule.outcomeMeasures[22]. Taxonomy identity does not imply supported statistical interpretation." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> ;
    ue:measures state:SexualOrientationDisclosure .

