    skos:scopeNote "The four-item questionnaire includes other questions; this metric averages only the two parental attitude ratings as specified. Source evidence: resultsSection.outcomeMeasuresModule.outcomeMeasures[21]. Taxonomy identity does not imply supported statistical interpretation." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> ;
